{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3yWybWNxQX2tF1AxF3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, heavy door. Iron-banded oak, ancient and scarred. A single keyhole glows faintly — waiting.*\n\n**🔒**\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye. Cold air breathes through it from the other side. You hear something — faint, rhythmic. A heartbeat? Footsteps? It stops when you lean closer.*\n\n*There is no handle. Only the keyhole.*\n\n*What do you have? What do you offer?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":115,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}